    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Temperature Convert</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span><span class=\"p-time\">10 min</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>A weather widget shows Fahrenheit, but the sensor reports Celsius. Write the</p>\n<p><code>CToF</code> helper that converts between them \u2014 and watch the constant arithmetic,</p>\n<p>where integer division is an easy trap.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>CToF</code> in temperature.go so it computes</p>\n<p><code>F = C*(9/5) + 32</code> correctly. The <code>freezingF</code> constant is already provided \u2014 do</p>\n<p>not change the signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nCToF(0)   // =&gt; 32\nCToF(100) // =&gt; 212\nCToF(-40) // =&gt; -40\nCToF(37)  // =&gt; 98.6\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Untyped constants</span><span class=\"tchip\">Constant kind</span><span class=\"tchip\">Mixed arithmetic</span></div></details>",
